      "writtenOn": "2025-01-17T22:12:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Right, and the handling still upholds the part about only allowing the name to change before the file is mapped. If someone is using this ioctl command, then `ASHMEM_GET_NAME` should return what they used for `ASHMEM_SET_NAME`, which is why I saved it in `d_fsdata`.",
